                                                "sense_id": "19cc47b0-8ada-3df9-b5fd-14927bff3a25",
                                                "text": "'Wild' is an anagram indicator showing that the letters of 'danger' have to be rearranged."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5d8e129b-0e60-43fc-b1fd-e67df6ce3f94",
                                                "sense_id": "19cc47b0-8ada-3df9-b5fd-14927bff3a25",
                                                "text": "We surrounded the strike, Snowy (5)\nSnowy is the definition in this clue. Ignore the punctuation and capital letter of Snowy! Surrounded is the container indicator."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b922fc13-c984-4250-aa00-c26fac4137e8",
                                                "sense_id": "19cc47b0-8ada-3df9-b5fd-14927bff3a25",
                                                "text": "We have already mentioned 'in' having multiple uses; 'round' or 'around' might be a container indicator or a reversal indicator; 'without' might be a container indicator or a deletion indicator, and so on."
